,"number_of_pages":114,"title":"DMG Vol 1: Amendment 54, June 2017","unique_reference":"DMG Vol 1 amendment 54","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e257b50e5274a6c45d9e659/v1am54.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"accessible.formats@dwp.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"5a758a6b40f0b6360e474e74","filename":"v1am53.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":153067,"filename":"v1am53.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9420969","isbn":"","number_of_pages":8,"title":"DMG Vol 1: Amendment 53, February 2017","unique_reference":"DMG Vol 1 amendment 53","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a758a6b40f0b6360e474e74/v1am53.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"accessible.formats@dwp.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"5a8055caed915d74e622ddc3","filename":"v1am52.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":447336,"filename":"v1am52.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9420970","isbn":"","number_of_pages":24,"title":"DMG Vol 1: Amendment 52, October 2016","unique_reference":"DMG Vol 1 amendment 52","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a8055caed915d74e622ddc3/v1am52.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"accessible.formats@dwp.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"5a7f766ae5274a2e87db600c","filename":"v1am51.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":335838,"filename":"v1am51.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9420971","isbn":"","number_of_pages":92,"title":"DMG Vol 1: Amendment 51, June 2016","unique_reference":"DMG Vol 1 amendment 51","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a7f766ae5274a2e87db600c/v1am51.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"accessible.formats@dwp.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"5a74f715e5274a59fa71659c","filename":"v1am50.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":173865,"filename":"v1am50.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9420972","isbn":"","number_of_pages":30,"title":"DMG Vol 1: Amendment 50, February 2016","unique_reference":"DMG Vol 1 amendment 50","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a74f715e5274a59fa71659c/v1am50.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>This guidance is for <abbr title=\"Department for Work and Pensions\">DWP</abbr> staff who make decisions about benefits and pensions. It helps them make decisions that are accurate and consistent.</p>\n\n<p>The introduction of Universal Credit and Personal Independence Payment affects the guidance <abbr title=\"Department for Work and Pensions\">DWP</abbr> staff use.</p>\n\n<p><abbr title=\"Department for Work and Pensions\">DWP</abbr> decision makers now use <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/advice-for-decision-making-staff-guide\">Advice for decision making</a> (instead of the <abbr title=\"Decision makers’ guide\">DMG</abbr>) for decisions that involve:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Universal Credit</li>\n  <li>Personal Independence Payment</li>\n  <li>contribution-based Jobseeker’s Allowance and contribution-based Employment and Support Allowance for <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/universal-credit/eligibility\">people who are eligible for Universal Credit</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"why-we-publish-this-guide\">Why we publish this guide</h2>\n\n<p>We publish this guide to help people understand how we make decisions.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"information-for-claimants\">Information for claimants</h2>\n\n<p>Information for claimants about eligibility and how to claim:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/browse/benefits\">benefits</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/browse/working/state-pension\">pensions</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Updated DMG Vol 1 Ch 2: Claims and DMG Vol 1 Annexes A to M. The changes are listed in the updated DMG Vol 1 summary of changes.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-29T07:42:24Z"},{"note":"Updated DMG chapters 2, 3 and 6. These are reflected in the updated DMG Vol 1: Summary of changes from October 2020.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-04T13:32:44Z"},{"note":"The following DMG chapters have been updated: DMG Vol 1 Ch 2: Claims, DMG Vol 1 Ch 3: Revision and DMG Vol 1 Ch 4: Supersession, suspension and termination. These are reflected in the updated DMG Vol 1: Summary of changes from October 2020","public_timestamp":"2026-05-22T14:54:13Z"},{"note":"Updated DMG Vol 1: Summary of changes from October 2020 and DMG Chapter 06: Making appeals and staying","public_timestamp":"2026-02-16T15:45:37Z"},{"note":"Updated 'DMG Vol 1 Annexes A to M', 'DMG Vol 1 Ch 3: Revision ', 'DMG Vol 1 Ch 6: Making appeals and staying' and 'DMG Vol 1 Summary of changes.' ","public_timestamp":"2025-12-04T14:29:39Z"},{"note":"Updated DMG Vol 1 Ch 4: Supersession, suspension and termination. See\r\nDMG Vol 1: Summary of changes from October 2020.","public_timestamp":"2025-10-31T13:47:47Z"},{"note":"DMH Vol 1 Ch 1, Ch 2, Ch 4, DMG Vol 1 summary of changes and DMG Vol 1 Annex A updated. ","public_timestamp":"2025-10-14T08:30:02Z"},{"note":"Updated DMG Vol 1 Ch 2: Claims, DMG Vol 1 Ch 3: Revision, DMG Vol 1 Ch 4: Supersession, suspension, DMG Vol 1 Annex A to M (Annex A): Relevant benefit and DMG Vol 1: Summary of changes from October 2020.","public_timestamp":"2025-10-02T14:19:44Z"},{"note":"Updated 'DMG Vol 1 Ch 2: Claims' and 'DMG Vol 1: Summary of changes from October 2020'.","public_timestamp":"2025-08-07T08:05:16Z"},{"note":"Updated: DMG Vol 1 Ch 2: Claims; DMG Vol 1 Ch 3: Revision; DMG Vol 1 Ch 4: Supersession, suspension and termination; DMG Vol 1 Annex A in Annexes A to M. The changes are listed in the updated volume 1 summary of changes.","public_timestamp":"2025-04-16T14:59:25Z"},{"note":"Updated DMG Vol 1 Ch 6: Making appeals and staying and DMG Vol 1: Summary of changes from October 2020 -- Updated March 2025.","public_timestamp":"2025-03-18T14:19:43Z"},{"note":"Updated DMG Vol 1 Ch 2: Claims, DMG Vol 1 Ch 3: Revision and DMG Vol 1 Ch 4: Supersession, suspension and termination with annotations to DMG memo 3/25: Identity of Claimants and Children -- effect of Upper Tribunal decision.","public_timestamp":"2025-03-03T14:46:41Z"},{"note":"Updated DMG Vol 1 Ch 2: Claims -- annotated with references to DMG memo 2/2025.","public_timestamp":"2025-02-20T14:56:23Z"},{"note":"Updated DMG Chapter 3 \"Revision\" at paragraph 03017 and DMG Chapter 6 \"Making appeals and staying\" at paragraph 06015 to include guidance from DMG memo 13/22 \"Reinstatement of a qualifying benefit and revision\". The rolling summary of changes has also been updated.","public_timestamp":"2025-01-23T08:14:10Z"},{"note":"Updated DMG Vol 1 Ch 1: Principles of decision making and evidence and DMG Volume 1: Summary of changes","public_timestamp":"2024-10-16T15:32:02Z"},{"note":"New Vol 1 Chapter 6: Making appeals and staying and new summary of changes added.","public_timestamp":"2024-09-11T14:09:57Z"},{"note":"Updated DMG Vol 1 Ch 6: Making appeals and staying and added Summary of changes from October 2020: February 2024.","public_timestamp":"2024-02-08T16:37:01Z"},{"note":"Updated DMG Vol 1 Ch 3: Revision, DMG Vol 1 Ch 4: Supersession, suspension and termination, and also DMG Vol 1: Summary of changes from October 2020","public_timestamp":"2024-01-10T16:36:37Z"},{"note":"Updated DMG Vol 1 Ch 1: Principles of decision making and evidence and also DMG Vol 1: Summary of changes from October 2020.","public_timestamp":"2023-08-01T14:40:29Z"},{"note":"DMG Vol