"},{"note":"Added revised DMG Vol 1: Amendment 54, June 2017 to include annotations to DMG Memo 01/20: Civil Partnerships for opposite sex couples. ","public_timestamp":"2020-01-20T10:45:02Z"},{"note":"Updated Chapter 3 'Revision'. The amendment updates paragraph 03025 point 3 to make clear that where the Decision Maker considers they have before them a hopeless application for supersession, no decision should be made. ","public_timestamp":"2019-06-28T15:17:19Z"},{"note":"Added updated version of Annexes A to M, which includes an updated Annex E within the document. ","public_timestamp":"2019-06-25T13:47:25Z"},{"note":"Added revised 'DMG Vol 1 Chapter 1: Principles of decision making and evidence' and associated amendment note 'DMG Vol 1: Amendment 59, June 2019'.","public_timestamp":"2019-06-25T10:50:58Z"},{"note":"Replaced DMG Vol 1 Annexes A to M following various corrections to the document. ","public_timestamp":"2019-06-14T08:17:16Z"},{"note":"Updated chapter 2 - Claims.","public_timestamp":"2019-05-30T11:07:02Z"},{"note":"Revised version of DMG Volume 1 chapter 3.","public_timestamp":"2019-05-10T08:33:06Z"},{"note":"Revised versions of DMG Volume 1 chapters 1, 2 and 4 with amendments listed in amendment 58. ","public_timestamp":"2019-04-11T14:29:12Z"},{"note":"Revised DMG chapter 2 annotated to DMG memo 1/19.","public_timestamp":"2019-02-20T13:42:47Z"},{"note":"Added revised DMG volume 1 chapters 1 and 2 with amendments listed in amendment 57.","public_timestamp":"2019-01-25T12:14:29Z"},{"note":"Revised DMG chapter 1 - update to guidance in paragraph 01031.","public_timestamp":"2018-11-13T12:38:32Z"},{"note":"Published revised DMG volume 1 chapter 2: Claims. Annotated to DMG memo 13/18.","public_timestamp":"2018-10-12T10:00:05Z"},{"note":"Published revised DMG volume 1, chapter 6 and amendment 56, which lists the amendments. ","public_timestamp":"2018-07-03T11:01:55Z"},{"note":"Published revised DMG volume 1, chapter 6 and amendment 55, which lists the amendme